          "id": "aa294f56bd3bb902c8986202ce37a42e9f0f18cf",
          "message": "liboqs 0.16.0 release candidate 1 (#2451)\n\n* Skeleton release\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* [skip ci] draft release notes, with to-do's\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Improved writing on release notes\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Format markdown\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Markdown formatting\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Let it rip [extended tests] [full tests]\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Double-checked first-time contributors\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* [skip ci] Updated release notes\n\nIncluded #2460, #2407, #2467, #2463, #2441\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Significant changes deserve more explanation\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Update release notes after #2431 merge\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Update RELEASE.md after #2470 merge\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Update 0.16.0-rc1 release date\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>",
