          "message": "Download Intel SDE from open-quantum-safe/ci-containers (#2463)\n\n* Try hosting Intel SDE from open-quantum-safe/ci-containers\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Visually inspect Intel SDE checksum\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Fixed typo\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Added source of Intel SDE 9.53.0 download and checksum\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Use set -e and diff to automate sha256 checksum comparison\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Switch to main branch in open-quantum-safe/ci-containers\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n* Switch from raw.gitusercontent.com to api.github.com\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Ganyu (Bruce) Xu <g66xu@uwaterloo.ca>",
