          "message": "Add missing LMS macros. Correct typo. (#2310)\n\n* Add missing LMS macros. Correct typo.\n\nSigned-off-by: Norman Ashley <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Fix format so that the correct hash can be calculated.\n\nSigned-off-by: Norman Ashley <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Skip slow running LMS tests.\n\nSigned-off-by: Norman Ashley <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Update KAT hash result. Skip tests if no test file present.\n\nSigned-off-by: Norman Ashley <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Restrict really slow testcases.\n\nSigned-off-by: Norman Ashley <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Restrict slow LMS variants.\n\nSigned-off-by: Norman Ashley <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Update tests/test_cmdline.py\n\nSigned-off-by: Norman Ashley <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Update tests/test_cmdline.py\n\nSigned-off-by: Norman Ashley <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Updates per review.\n\nSigned-off-by: Norman Ashley <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Update per review: use pytest.xfail.\n\nSigned-off-by: Norman Ashley <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Norman Ashley <nashley@cisco.com>",
