          "message": "Add NIST LMS Signature verify KATs (#2435)\n\n* Add utilities to ease processing public key buffer.\n\nSigned-off-by: ashman-p <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Process public key to process LMS public key buffers without explicit levels.\n\nSigned-off-by: ashman-p <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Update hash results for NIST based KATs.\n\nSigned-off-by: ashman-p <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Use NIST based KATs.\n\nSigned-off-by: ashman-p <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Update test to read NIST HSS and LMS public keys.\n\nSigned-off-by: ashman-p <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Fix formatting errors.\n\nSigned-off-by: Norman Ashley <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Correct hash results.\n\nSigned-off-by: Norman Ashley <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Update HSS/LMS Public key detection type.\n\nSigned-off-by: ashman-p <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n* Update public key and sig OTS field matching.\n\nSigned-off-by: ashman-p <nashley@cisco.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: ashman-p <nashley@cisco.com>\nSigned-off-by: Norman Ashley <nashley@cisco.com>",
